    },
    {
      "id": "NQIjaKMiRWVU_qXezMx6P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3618.321470210895,
      "y": 1385.7571454020579,
      "width": 615.4398193359375,
      "height": 595,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1230537733,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 1631755525,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785314415895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A log can go to:\n\n    Console\n    File\n    Database (later)\n    Kafka (later)\n    \nShould Logger know how to print to console?\n❌ No.\n\nShould Logger know how to write a file?\n❌ No.\n\nLogger's only responsibility is:\n    \"I received a log.\"\n\nSomeone else should decide where it goes.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A log can go to:\n\n    Console\n    File\n    Database (later)\n    Kafka (later)\n    \nShould Logger know how to print to console?\n❌ No.\n\nShould Logger know how to write a file?\n❌ No.\n\nLogger's only responsibility is:\n    \"I received a log.\"\n\nSomeone else should decide where it goes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "688cZ1wjyN50FLR2D7As_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3736.9181643311817,
      "y": 2026.8899588729005,
      "width": 164.86390686035156,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1951550859,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 1016692267,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785314451348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Logger\n    ↓\nAppender\n    ↓\nConsole/File",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Logger\n    ↓\nAppender\n    ↓\nConsole/File",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TqNsZlxFAHKg2VNQIB-p8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4319.974451472283,
      "y": 1401.5625432015363,
      "width": 558.7957763671875,
      "height": 1260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2049937579,
      "version": 188,
      "versionNonce": 375559211,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785314633863,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How will ConsoleAppender print?\n\nSuppose LogMessage is\n     \n        INFO\n        User Logged In\n        \nShould ConsoleAppender itself format it?\n    cout << \"[INFO] User Logged In\";\n❌ No.\n\nBecause tomorrow:\n        Plain Text\n              ↓\n            JSON\n\nAgain ConsoleAppender changes.\n\n    Bad.\n\nInstead\n        ConsoleAppender\n          HAS-A\n        LogFormatter\n\nConsoleAppender asks formatter:\n\n    \"Give me a formatted string.\"\n\nThis is Composition.\n\nConsoleAppender\n        |\n        |\n        ▼\n LogFormatter",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How will ConsoleAppender print?\n\nSuppose LogMessage is\n     \n        INFO\n        User Logged In\n        \nShould ConsoleAppender itself format it?\n    cout << \"[INFO] User Logged In\";\n❌ No.\n\nBecause tomorrow:\n        Plain Text\n              ↓\n            JSON\n\nAgain ConsoleAppender changes.\n\n    Bad.\n\nInstead\n        ConsoleAppender\n          HAS-A\n        LogFormatter\n\nConsoleAppender asks formatter:\n\n    \"Give me a formatted string.\"\n\nThis is Composition.\n\nConsoleAppender\n        |\n        |\n        ▼\n LogFormatter",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
